# No Cursor attribution

- Do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor/cursoragent trailer to commits or PRs.
- Do not pass `--trailer` for Cursor attribution.
- If a trailer is injected anyway, strip it before pushing (amend only when amend rules allow; otherwise a new commit that rewrites the message via rebase/filter).
- GitHub author/co-author must remain the human owner only (`alloteyphil` / Philip Allotey).
